  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DCED &#xE4;r den st&#xF6;rsta och oj&#xE4;mf&#xF6;rligt viktigaste givarplattformen inom provatsektorutveckling. Alla relevanta bilaterala och multilaterala givare deltar i DCEDs arbete. DCEDs nuvarande aktiviteter inkluderar bl.a. (i) reformer av n&#xE4;ringslivsklimatet, (ii)  privatsektorutveckling i konfliktomr&#xE5;den och (iii) resultatm&#xE4;tning i PSD</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Donor Committee on Enterprise Development (DCED) is the main donor platform in the field of private sector development. All relevant bilateral and multilateral actors participate in the DCED. DCED present activities cover i.a. (i) Business Environment Reforms, (ii) PSD in Conflict Areas and (iii) Results Measurement in PSD.</narrative>
  </description>
